  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education for out of school children and adolecents in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF supports Alternative Learning Pathways (ALP)  /non-formal education as an important strategy to reduce numbers of out-of-school children and adolescents. ALPs supplement the existing formal system, where there are no schools or because parents are not willing or able to utilize them, or for children who have dropped out.</narrative>
  </description>
